{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Design decision 2026-11-05 (operator): rebar stores release NAMES on each ticket, exactly like tags; no release records. A Jira rename surfaces as remove+add on affected tickets; release status/dates stay in Jira."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793914850858496001,"uuid":"48565745-61ea-40f1-90de-3a3ac5bda2fb"}